  <main id="main">

    <!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
    <section class="page-head industry-head">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">How we work</span>
        <h1>We prove it works on your real work <em>before you pay for the full build.</em></h1>
        <p class="lead hero__say">Map and measure the work, try a small version on real cases, then build it, train your team and report the time saved every month. <b>You can stop after any step.</b></p>
        <div class="btn-row page-head__cta">
          <a class="btn btn--primary btn--large" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-method-book-top">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
          <a href="#score" class="btn btn--ghost btn--large">Score an opportunity</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- ============ THREE STEPS ============ -->
    <section class="section section--tint" id="steps" aria-labelledby="stTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">At a glance</span>
          <h2 id="stTitle">Three steps, and a way out after each one.</h2>
        </div>
        <ol class="three reveal">
          <li><span class="three__n">1</span><b>Find</b><p>We look at how the work is done today, measure it, and say what&rsquo;s worth automating.</p><span class="three__meta">1&ndash;2 weeks · <span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span></span><span class="three__stop">You can stop here, and keep the map</span></li>
          <li><span class="three__n">2</span><b>Prove</b><p>A small version works on real cases, and we measure the time it saves.</p><span class="three__meta">2&ndash;4 weeks · from <span data-zar="35000">R35,000</span></span><span class="three__stop">You can stop here if it doesn&rsquo;t pay</span></li>
          <li><span class="three__n">3</span><b>Build and run</b><p>Connected to your systems, your team trained, and a report on the time saved every month.</p><span class="three__meta">from <span data-zar="85000">R85,000</span>, then from <span data-zar="7500">R7,500</span> a month</span><span class="three__stop">Month to month after 3 months</span></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ PHASES ============ -->
    <section class="section" id="phases" aria-labelledby="phTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">In detail</span>
          <h2 id="phTitle">What happens, what you get, and what we need from you.</h2>
        </div>
        <ol class="mphases">
          <li class="mphase reveal"><span class="mphase__n">01</span><div><h3>We look at how the work is done today</h3><p class="mphase__out"><b>You get:</b> a map of the work and how long it takes today.</p><p class="mphase__you"><b>Your part:</b> Two or three one-hour sessions, and examples of the work.</p></div><span class="mphase__tag">Find</span></li>
          <li class="mphase reveal"><span class="mphase__n">02</span><div><h3>We score what&rsquo;s worth automating</h3><p class="mphase__out"><b>You get:</b> a ranked list, and which to build first.</p><p class="mphase__you"><b>Your part:</b> An hour to go through the list with us and pick the first one.</p></div><span class="mphase__tag">Find</span></li>
          <li class="mphase reveal"><span class="mphase__n">03</span><div><h3>We try a small version on real work</h3><p class="mphase__out"><b>You get:</b> a small version working on real cases.</p><p class="mphase__you"><b>Your part:</b> A weekly 30-minute check-in, and someone testing it on real cases.</p></div><span class="mphase__tag">Prove</span></li>
          <li class="mphase reveal"><span class="mphase__n">04</span><div><h3>We check the time it saved</h3><p class="mphase__out"><b>You get:</b> the time it saved, and a decision: go, adjust or stop.</p><p class="mphase__you"><b>Your part:</b> A 30-minute review to decide: go, adjust or stop.</p></div><span class="mphase__tag">Prove</span></li>
          <li class="mphase reveal"><span class="mphase__n">05</span><div><h3>We build it properly into your systems</h3><p class="mphase__out"><b>You get:</b> the finished system, connected to your tools.</p><p class="mphase__you"><b>Your part:</b> Access to the systems it connects to, and someone to sign it off.</p></div><span class="mphase__tag">Build and run</span></li>
          <li class="mphase reveal"><span class="mphase__n">06</span><div><h3>We train your team</h3><p class="mphase__out"><b>You get:</b> a team that uses it.</p><p class="mphase__you"><b>Your part:</b> One session per team that uses it.</p></div><span class="mphase__tag">Build and run</span></li>
          <li class="mphase reveal"><span class="mphase__n">07</span><div><h3>We keep it working, and make it better</h3><p class="mphase__out"><b>You get:</b> a monthly report of the time saved.</p><p class="mphase__you"><b>Your part:</b> Read the monthly report. Partner plans add a monthly review call.</p></div><span class="mphase__tag">Build and run</span></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ SCORER ============ -->
    <section class="section section--tint" id="score" aria-labelledby="scTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head section__head--center reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Try it on your own ideas</span>
          <h2 id="scTitle">Score an opportunity.</h2>
          <p>Score a few ideas and see which to build first. Not sure? Just name the task.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="opp reveal" data-opp>
          <div class="opp__form">
            <label class="opp__name"><span>The opportunity</span><input type="text" name="name" maxlength="60" placeholder="e.g. Prepare replies to quote requests" /></label>
            <label class="roi__field"><span>How much time would it save?</span><output data-opp-out="time">7</output><input type="range" name="time" min="0" max="10" value="7" /></label>
            <label class="roi__field"><span>Could it bring in more money?</span><output data-opp-out="revenue">5</output><input type="range" name="revenue" min="0" max="10" value="5" /></label>
            <label class="roi__field"><span>How hard do you think it is to build? <small>(higher = harder)</small></span><output data-opp-out="difficulty">4</output><input type="range" name="difficulty" min="0" max="10" value="4" /></label>
            <label class="roi__field"><span>Is the information it needs easy to get?</span><output data-opp-out="data">7</output><input type="range" name="data" min="0" max="10" value="7" /></label>
            <label class="roi__field"><span>How bad would a mistake be? <small>(higher = worse)</small></span><output data-opp-out="risk">3</output><input type="range" name="risk" min="0" max="10" value="3" /></label>
            <label class="roi__field"><span>Will the team actually use it?</span><output data-opp-out="adoption">7</output><input type="range" name="adoption" min="0" max="10" value="7" /></label>
          </div>
          <div class="opp__out" aria-live="polite">
            <div class="opp__dial" style="--s:0"><b data-opp-score>0</b><span>/ 100</span></div>
            <p class="opp__band" data-opp-band></p>
            <p class="opp__gate" data-opp-gate hidden></p>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost btn--full" data-opp-add>Add to my list</button>
            <ol class="opp__list" data-opp-list></ol>
            <p class="tiny muted">Time saved counts most. If the information isn&rsquo;t ready, we fix that first; if a mistake would be costly, a person approves every result.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <form class="sendme reveal" data-sendme="opp" novalidate>
          <p class="sendme__t">Email me my scores, highest first.</p>
          <div class="sendme__row">
            <input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="you@company.com" aria-label="Your email address" />
            <input type="text" name="business" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Business (optional)" aria-label="Business name (optional)" />
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary btn--small">Email it to me</button>
          </div>
          <input type="text" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;opacity:0" />
          <p class="tiny muted sendme__msg" data-sendme-msg aria-live="polite">We&rsquo;ll send it once and may follow up once. <a class="inline-link" href="privacy">Privacy</a></p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ MEASUREMENT ============ -->
    <section class="section" id="measure" aria-labelledby="msTitle">
      <div class="container split">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">How we measure</span>
          <h2 id="msTitle">Timed before. Timed after. Reported monthly.</h2>
          <p class="lead">We time the work before we change anything, then the same way after. That&rsquo;s the number in your report.</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="mlist reveal">
          <li><b>Hours saved</b><span>How long it took before, minus how long it takes now.</span></li>
          <li><b>What they&rsquo;re worth</b><span>Those hours, at what the people doing it cost you.</span></li>
          <li><b>When it pays for itself</b><span>The build cost, divided by what it saves each month.</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="small muted reveal mlist__ex">Example: 3 people spending 5 hours a week on it, with 60% taken over, get about 39 hours a month back.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ REUSE ============ -->
    <section class="section section--dark" aria-labelledby="reTitle">
      <div class="container trust">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Why it gets better</span>
          <h2 id="reTitle">Every job makes the next one faster.</h2>
          <blockquote>Each system we build leaves parts we can reuse. <em>The next client in your industry starts further ahead.</em></blockquote>
        </div>
        <ul class="trust__points reveal">
          <li><strong>Faster delivery</strong><span>Proven components instead of starting from scratch.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Fewer surprises</strong><span>We&rsquo;ve seen where that process breaks before.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Better results</strong><span>Every measured result sharpens the next estimate.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Future-proof</strong><span>When better AI arrives, your system gets it.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ CTA ============ -->
    <section class="cta" aria-labelledby="ctaTitle">
      <div class="container cta__inner reveal">
        <span class="cta__services">Find · Prove · Build and run</span>
        <h2 id="ctaTitle">Start with a free 30-minute review.</h2>
        <p>We hear the problem and tell you honestly whether AI is the answer. If it is, the Find step comes next, at a fixed price.</p>
        <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
          <a class="btn btn--light btn--large" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-method-book">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
        </div>
        <p class="cta__alt">Prefer to write? <button type="button" class="inline-link" data-review-open>Tell us in a few lines</button></p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
